 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種: 晩春〜初夏に茎を約15cmに詰めて草丈を抑え枝数を増やす（初夏に草丈を詰める記述）。花後の切り戻し（MBG・stauden.de）と晩秋の刈り取り（RHS・品種）もある。株分けは数年ごと／2〜4年ごとで D ではない。機械の B は初夏の切り詰めを拾えていない。種の文なので 中",
  "management_type_quote": "Prune stems to 6\" in late spring or early summer to encourage a bushier habit, stronger stems, and shorter height if desired.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": null,
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/種] Good air circulation and consistently moist soils with good drainage help reduce incidence of foliar diseases.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
